# Vendored Galaxy content (mirrors .gitignore). The image installs its
# own fresh copies via `ansible-galaxy collection/role install` in the
# RUN step before `COPY . .` runs -- the host's local copies are never
# read by the image and only bloat the build context (~55 MB here),
# which gets re-hashed/re-sent on every `podman build` call.
